sequenceDiagram
    participant Fabric
    participant Grounding
    participant AgentProvider
    participant Agent

    Fabric->>AgentProvider: spawn request with contract
    AgentProvider->>Grounding: build_agent_lease(contract scope)
    Grounding-->>AgentProvider: AgentGroundingLease
    AgentProvider->>Agent: execute with lease
    Agent->>AgentProvider: result with grounding references
